# Build outputs — the gate rebuilds values.maxon fresh (see values.expected.txt). Only the source
# sample and the expected transcript are tracked; the compiled binary, its sidecar, and the build
# cache are not.
# Unanchored, so it covers both a sample that is a single file here and one that is a DIRECTORY —
# testsample/ is a whole project, and `maxon test` writes its binary and manifest into
# testsample/.maxon/cache/, which an anchored `/.maxon/` would not reach.
.maxon/
*.exe
*.mxdbg
*.mxcov

